{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b45f88c97c5ea41f32aee1a1ca81bb87ddf17b6f9606a46d8b3cdbde665f3526", "ja": "アートのめばえ", "zh": "艺术萌芽", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a53d787c0b2d57b98554d51ce627bf5251732154b71f26d7d01dbd0ad264e622", "ja": "765プロを挙げたツアー企画の第2弾が開催\n決定。チーム『CLEVER CLOVER』の\nメンバーとして、トップバッターを任された\nのは、星梨花、あずさ、海美、ロコの4人。\nやや難解なテーマの新曲に挑む事に。", "zh": "765艺能事务所全员参与的巡回演出的第2期企划\n决定举办。作为“CLEVER CLOVER”队的\n成员，被委以打头阵重任的\n是星梨花、梓、海美、ROCO这4人。\n她们将要挑战主题略显深奥的新曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fff919efb65392af06966cab7ca0cba0a0bed33b74c9d5e9665aacfdb3d8977d", "ja": "（コンテンポラリーダンス。\nジャンルとして聞いた事はあるけど……）", "zh": "（现代舞。虽然听说过这个流派，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f4313abe315fe68bd1f3684a28ccaa3c11491987570f6e5907597dd6032a5cb2", "ja": "（取り急ぎコンテンポラリーダンスの事を詳しく\n知るために、資料としてアート系の書籍を集めてきた）", "zh": "（为了尽快详细了解现代舞，我收集了一些艺术类书籍作为资料。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7576286515bd1a8502e69fe4b95f4cdff4e2f17ce0f00c0fc55b8ef35e4c73b7", "ja": "ミーティングまで、まだ時間があるな。\nそれまでに読んでおこう……。", "zh": "距离会议还有时间。\n趁这段时间先读一下吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1003_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "5628a9eb6769fb754fdb0a0595d86fcfe7267494dc1bce8083f90f5a1f9bf291", "ja": "ミリオンシアターシーズン、いよいよわたしたちの\n出番なんですね。とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "百万剧场季，终于轮到我们\n出场了呢。真是期待万分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "b7b0b1d0bfe1c9102dd4a735d4be2321465ccb695b57f65f816f0d0cd85b7911", "ja": "私たちは、CLEVER CLOVER、だったよね？\n楽しみすぎて、今から体がウズウズしちゃうよーっ☆", "zh": "我们是CLEVER CLOVER，对吧？\n太期待了，现在身体就已经跃跃欲试啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "2985b87e7bfca5188f60134808a958753e129775e24154665b16395ce6c9fabf", "ja": "劇場のみんなで、日本のあらゆるディヴィジョンに\nアクセス……イノベーショナルなプロジェクトです♪", "zh": "和剧场的大家一起，访问日本各地的所有分区……真是个创新项目呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "22cd666b9cf8f451fb14f8008d501d6cb9aa3fcb6990e1c16b6d75e9cab67247", "ja": "これから、ツアーで忙しくなりそうだし……\nいろいろ準備をしておかなくちゃね。", "zh": "接下来巡演会变得忙碌起来，所以……\n得提前做好各种准备才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "62516b0945d12b782d198f1dddbcd6e39205b66c396e4c8029e68dc7fbc5cb44", "ja": "準備っていうと……やっぱり基本のスクワットから？\n長距離走って、スタミナつける？", "zh": "说到准备……果然还是要先从基础深蹲开始？\n跑长距离，增强体力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "8266fe9b6a9aaa25c29a9caa3ed3ffa0e1fbdb01a9477542e3064577bb85a76b", "ja": "新しいプロジェクトは大歓迎ですけど、\nロコ、ハードワークはちょっと……。", "zh": "虽然我很欢迎新项目，\n但ROCO，高强度工作还是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "96d529b624587bab19b62e9b72dd5d9141b25381f47ad861693eca234ddba249", "ja": "そうね。ミーティングまで、まだ時間があるし……\nお茶でもしながら、相談しましょうか？", "zh": "是啊。离开会还有时间……要不要边喝茶边商量一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b2f6d252866c1e4075e0f8d20e3ab00f8e9cc5f90d36566f2f65a03349cdcb84", "ja": "（まずは、勉強して理解を深める事だ。絵画の\n図版を眺めていると、見えてくるものがある……）", "zh": "（首先还是要学习，加深理解。凝视着绘画的图版，似乎能看见一些东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1b898334470b2d2a1eaea8a23978347790983ad6df91f743135362b2bfc4cc59", "ja": "絵画、芸術の意義……。\n真理を描く……とは、どういう事なんだろうか……。", "zh": "绘画、艺术的意义……描绘真理……究竟是怎么一回事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "dd24691314dd1f4f27e56a16e05f8961e16e8e1171462e42b27e4199dafb2e0e", "ja": "あれ？　あそこにいるのって……\nお疲れさま、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦？那边的是……\n辛苦了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3dfcfa36e9762a515eb9f2505d2ee5f573b311288f2e4f05b318342cff4b414c", "ja": "はっ！？　……おお、お疲れさま。\nみんな、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊！？……哦，辛苦了。\n大家这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "b5854fe8a1390dbc97085d5d13d1513f9a0c569c402a7a9859f4f91c8582b57f", "ja": "わたしたち、ミーティングまでお茶をしようと思って。", "zh": "我们打算在开会前一起喝喝茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "fc5da30b64fdcc360dabac7a9b3980ae4a2f90c6d232779453af65a0ed0ce29b", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、絵を見てるんですか？\n……素敵なヴァイオリンの絵ですね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生是在看画吗？\n……好棒的小提琴画作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2dd1dc2fdb1d9d32a9dbc6dc2d8dbd45e77bf17998111df3aa0ea0d12deba754", "ja": "いや、アートを理解するのは難しいなと思って……\nん？　星梨花にはこの絵、ヴァイオリンに見えるのか？", "zh": "不，我只是觉得，要理解艺术还挺难的……\n嗯？星梨花看这幅画，觉得它像小提琴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "425bb53bc79e3e49b83dde0eadef88ee095ea7b27315460e96e0087761e28c41", "ja": "はい！　違うんですか？", "zh": "是的！不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7d8a3ea518ae1c1d81c9823b5787e8ea3fc701ec743899474a7c957bc2591090", "ja": "いや、違うというわけじゃ……そうか、星梨花には\nこれがヴァイオリンの絵に見えるのか……。", "zh": "不，倒也不是说不对……这样啊，在星梨花眼里，\n这幅画看起来像是小提琴啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "4be3e5bcdad3d5794e34257e38027614a229f5c2c8d482755f7548dd5eeb4c69", "ja": "ロコには、ハトに見えます。ミッドナイトに\n羽ばたいている、小さなハトです！", "zh": "在ROCO看来，这像一只鸽子。是只在午夜展翅飞翔的小鸽子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6d0b969aba8e963761115184241f5f87da4b2984e3478a27dd07536ff22c1b7e", "ja": "そ、そうか。俺には、ヴァイオリンにもハトにも\n見えないけど……いっそ、逆さにして見るとか……？", "zh": "是、是吗。可我既看不出是小提琴，也看不出是鸽子……要不，干脆倒过来看看……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d87adcb59638b308ba0ea0880b8dd92282e140948f921d10d6d65d5664f103e", "ja": "あ、わかった！　この絵、ダンベルだね！\nほら、男の人が両手に持ってるでしょ？", "zh": "啊，我知道了！这幅画是哑铃吧！\n你看，那个男人不是正用双手拿着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "ffa39564761d624c70c9ffdc4d85b8c16b354ada37412c6db9477bd3287faeff", "ja": "ダンベル……海美ちゃんには、そう見えるのね。", "zh": "哑铃……在海美看来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "a24a67910dc4436297c18b7e58967715ef43eaf5086ac4b7f7d84c0563cdb8c7", "ja": "私は、タロットの『力』のカードかなと思って、\n見てたんですけど。", "zh": "我当时想着那大概是塔罗牌里的『力量』，所以才那样看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "be2316b50fab05b5c952c288c23067d2809ab1c34db9b6338834f066412be72d", "ja": "三者三様ならぬ四者四様だな……。でも、そうか。\n無理に理解しようとするより、思うままに……。", "zh": "不只是三人三种风格，而是四人四种风格啊……不过，说得也是。与其勉强去理解，不如顺着自己的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e56c687aae8d4ee9b6a01cf9f0c503b22094d06767b5e8222bdf2097f6a82ea8", "ja": "感性は多様な方が表現も広がる……\nやっぱり、今回の新曲は4人にぴったりだな。", "zh": "感性越多样，表现形式也会越丰富……果然，这次的新歌很适合4人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "148e6af920d068838c0c1ca59d259d0a4da447fc36553d017fab9e6d31fe7b84", "ja": "{$P$}が、コンセントレーション\nしてるロコみたいになってます……。", "zh": "{$P$}看起来变得像是在集中精神的ROCO一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "06ed66af60153fb63abfa05bec04f64f76a947f0f224bf62810ccd0b043c5bff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れですか？\nもし辛いなら、ミーティングはまた今度にしても……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您累了吗？\n要是难受的话，碰头会也可以改天再开……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "f6b86361f74c45b56ad8fb3dad62304249d89aadb8c1c86149ae5bd3224a2d47", "ja": "いや、大丈夫です！　それよりみんな、\nこの曲を聞いてみてくれないか？", "zh": "不，我没事的！比起这个，大家\n能听听看这首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "6cb1b86a48ec19cb85cb1794a88ff0eeeb7fa02238dc0883f55bea3b538050cd", "ja": "おお……\nなんか、すっごくオシャレな曲じゃない！？", "zh": "哇……\n这首歌感觉特别时髦啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "123fcd9174fcf85ffcaaf84c1b932c52875269d05ab732ead619898cdb26fcbf", "ja": "アーティスティックですね！　特にリズムの\nオリジナリティが、ロコ的にフェイバリットです！", "zh": "很有艺术感呢！尤其是节奏的独创性，从ROCO的角度来说，我特别喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "45b8cae0754d26612cf6db422b04ac76653ed9d174f4c2760fe88f415c3f318d", "ja": "曲が進む度に、印象が変わりますね。\n静かだけど、力強さもあって。", "zh": "随着曲子的推进，给人的印象也在不断变化呢。\n安静，却又充满力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "922d8422e2c25a672f67d5789d550a06a076b4b9acee1ca2973f81015913eb52", "ja": "なんだか、不思議な曲です……。\n歌詞も……。", "zh": "总觉得，这是首不可思议的歌……  \n歌词也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab816db7ca570972cbb436fbd86bad1a505e43683e06180cf57ccc76fe3fa53a", "ja": "あれ……？　同じ曲の感想なのに、\nみんなバラバラだったね？", "zh": "奇怪……？明明听的是同一首歌，\n大家的感想却都不一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "a054e92b64107f267c62a7f532be7f0445324a19c8796464f1dca43afc55c98c", "ja": "でも、みなさんの言ってることも、\nなんとなくわかる気がします。", "zh": "不过，我好像也有点明白大家说的意思了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "fd2b8663a995f81fd41dcf909aefd5aa290fb13e401687ed4d7eb94015c3277d", "ja": "そうね。きっと、今言ったいろいろな要素が\n混ざっている曲なんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "是啊。我想，这应该是一首融合了刚才提到的各种要素的歌曲吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "038fb37bd9689b3641989c2e6e3fae314f94c7252ff196135315b065abd9c0d3", "ja": "アートをアナライズするには、マルチファクト、\nつまり色々な角度から見ることが必要なんです！", "zh": "要分析艺术，就需要多重因素，也就是要从各种角度去观察！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "0b7490660c2be0447ad49729ca6ff9ea4dbf83f406313111c510393cc5363c3d", "ja": "ロコの言うとおりだな。この曲には、\nみんなの多彩な感性が必要みたいだ。", "zh": "正如ROCO所说。这首歌好像需要大家多彩的感性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "34c08279947b0560c65dea0c200df317cf137508d53345e04c07f3afdf1de902", "ja": "というわけで……CLEVER CLOVER\n第一弾の曲は、この4人で行こうと思う！", "zh": "所以……CLEVER CLOVER第一弹的歌曲，我打算就由这4人来唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "9d36bfc0fd6025723ba8f1624dcb3e93c8cd926b550a136c2f4f26e413345723", "ja": "わたしが、この曲を歌うんですか？\nなんだかドキドキします……。", "zh": "要由我来唱这首歌吗？\n总觉得有些紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1042_010azu", "source_sha256": "36fb908d4558bf7429c195e21e8de5d0911fa9dd37c45c5fb09bd7d83d704782", "ja": "私も……けど、不思議と惹かれます。\n歌わせてもらえるなら、ぜひ。", "zh": "我也是……不过，不知为何被吸引住了。如果能让我来唱的话，我很愿意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "6a82ac458b639e61822741172e92ce3634dadc95b50868e3832460b8528cd11e", "ja": "もちろん、ロコもジョインしますよ♪", "zh": "当然，ROCO也会加入哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "a4037cdd37769819fcf33b43eb7cee8cfff52d54fb76df56344415be1bab25a6", "ja": "私も私も！　トップバッターとして、\n目にもの見せちゃうから！", "zh": "我也要我也要！作为第一个上场的人，就让你们好好见识一下我的厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "1088d99330051a3525e4fabc97e24fd30c4d0239b7affd72afdc2b12f3510c3d", "ja": "ありがとう、みんな。\nコンテンポラリーダンス、よろしく頼んだぞ！", "zh": "谢谢大家。\n现代舞就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "e81669c1d995b79eb2c1700fbe22fa664a83be0f3ba7661ac78356d901e257cb", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンス……？\nえっと、そういうダンスを踊るんですか？", "zh": "现代舞……？\n呃，是跳那种舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1047_010azu", "source_sha256": "4cf13b24258e28889f416a6c0b3fe76a9fe516872cc782ea4b646c51a45b3888", "ja": "名前だけは聞いたことがありますけど……\nどういったものなのかしら……？", "zh": "名字我倒是听说过……\n不过具体是什么样的舞蹈呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "93f5295a372b56edfb696c90438cbf266dfa6754142a30a9e213347a0f40b4b8", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンス……昔、\nバレエ教室で聞いたことあるような……？", "zh": "现代舞……以前好像在芭蕾舞教室听说过……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1049_025roc", "source_sha256": "1601f54b767f2c94d6d9a8581677669adaae3f5eae740caad9521f822dba025f", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンスは、\n形の決まっていない自由なダンスのことですよ！", "zh": "现代舞，就是一种没有固定形式的自由舞蹈哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1050_025roc", "source_sha256": "511ded71cdb1c7ddfda57aafae5b5d44288af908f5c0003d5881f1b036d366cc", "ja": "といっても、ロコも\n実際に踊ったことはないですけど……。", "zh": "话虽如此，ROCO我也没实际跳过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_01_1051_p", "source_sha256": "db3a7696039e51c55f596c780ed9478f014934c4ee7f7e77155fe8858902c1ed", "ja": "（みんな0からのスタートだけど、焦る事はない。\nこの4人と、先進的で芸術的な公演を目指そう！）", "zh": "（大家都是从0开始的，不用着急。就和这4个人一起，朝着先进又富有艺术性的公演努力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
